{"title":"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Slowest)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Slowest)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Slow)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Slow)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Quick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Quick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Quickest)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Quickest)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are two values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for which the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782a7d47e8f237b0150c0a449b6144e2521d2736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + ax + 8x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> has only one solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. What is the sum of those values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a73d01dacee48a6f91315c4504f9375b79308ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mathrm {A}) \\ -16 \\qquad (\\mathrm {B}) \\ -8 \\qquad (\\mathrm {C})\\ 0 \\qquad (\\mathrm {D}) \\ 8 \\qquad (\\mathrm {E})\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"404\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=222\">https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=222</a>\n~AVM2023\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Slowest.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Slowest)\">Solution 1 (Slowest)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Slowest)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We first rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782a7d47e8f237b0150c0a449b6144e2521d2736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + ax + 8x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca0e74c624692456a7803255474dd51704344bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + (a+8)x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" />. Since there is only one root, the discriminant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9c5a0f2990db3d735a70bcceed512514a7e5813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2-144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />, has to be 0. We solve the remaining as below:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1443b481b1b9e2b90b6ebd26d9f9f855cd22bb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2 = a^2+16a+64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"21\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e89fb2534c8ca839bc89ff00c7a6f249ca87a800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a+64-144=a^2+16a-80=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"324\" height=\"18\" />.\nTo apply the quadratic formula, we rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea691e358a7bbde9cd92ecaf9641c6c6ead1ca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a-80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663d77721481c6f7b9949b22bbbea43ccb4706cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a+-80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />.\nThen the formula yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a5f8caadbc21fb08acddcbf54f06b359cd6e9b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-16\\pm24}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" />.\nWhich is,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d121fce9c857789f25496d00d07ee6cc918d3a61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8\\pm12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />.\nThis gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f1588c7ab561762e3d7b81887b584140570fd01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which sums up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/00695def4b33258214399ac3b4bf68e616d44fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-16\\text{ (A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />.\n~AVM2023\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Slow.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Slow)\">Solution 2 (Slow)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Slow)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We first rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782a7d47e8f237b0150c0a449b6144e2521d2736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + ax + 8x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca0e74c624692456a7803255474dd51704344bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + (a+8)x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" />. Since there is only one root, the discriminant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9c5a0f2990db3d735a70bcceed512514a7e5813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2-144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />, has to be 0. We expand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24cfee77d8729bdbbd1a7604d0fa4a2541a0842.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/9/bf944a3ea0e30bbd190291077467cef87c3fa799.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a+64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />. Applying our discriminant rule yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e89fb2534c8ca839bc89ff00c7a6f249ca87a800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a+64-144=a^2+16a-80=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"324\" height=\"18\" />.\nTo apply the quadratic formula, we rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea691e358a7bbde9cd92ecaf9641c6c6ead1ca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a-80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663d77721481c6f7b9949b22bbbea43ccb4706cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+16a+-80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />.\nThen the formula yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a5f8caadbc21fb08acddcbf54f06b359cd6e9b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-16\\pm24}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" />.\nWhich is,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d121fce9c857789f25496d00d07ee6cc918d3a61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8\\pm12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />.\nNotice that we have to find the sum of the two values, since the average is obviously <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/922c4f40c55a550006c796efcd63a7828ecfd95f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/055699b03efc43125cf7373d31dc806b0f1a6e5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot-8=\\boxed{-16\\text{ (A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"146\" height=\"30\" />.\n~AVM2023\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Quick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Quick)\">Solution 3 (Quick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Quick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We first rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782a7d47e8f237b0150c0a449b6144e2521d2736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + ax + 8x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca0e74c624692456a7803255474dd51704344bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + (a+8)x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" />. Since there is only one root, the discriminant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9c5a0f2990db3d735a70bcceed512514a7e5813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2-144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />, has to be 0. We solve the remaining as below:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/2/c22f48259f74029bb42fe3880ede5942baa6c595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2-144=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" /> so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3b4adefdff8f43ee739713cfa41ac04550a70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2=144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />.\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/f/09fa6605dd2d1c469a7d60f1101607a805f3882b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dcadf6b880a738849845ef4a0bb57403e9898359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, which make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f1588c7ab561762e3d7b81887b584140570fd01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, respectively. The sum of these values is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/00695def4b33258214399ac3b4bf68e616d44fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-16\\text{ (A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />.\n~AVM2023\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Quickest.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Quickest)\">Solution 4 (Quickest)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Quickest)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We first rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782a7d47e8f237b0150c0a449b6144e2521d2736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + ax + 8x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/a/aca0e74c624692456a7803255474dd51704344bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 + (a+8)x + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" />. Since there is only one root, the discriminant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/c/c9c5a0f2990db3d735a70bcceed512514a7e5813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2-144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />, has to be 0. We solve the remaining as below:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/2/c22f48259f74029bb42fe3880ede5942baa6c595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2-144=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" /> so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3b4adefdff8f43ee739713cfa41ac04550a70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+8)^2=144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />.\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/f/09fa6605dd2d1c469a7d60f1101607a805f3882b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> is either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/a/dcadf6b880a738849845ef4a0bb57403e9898359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, which make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/58289bf3312a59efb6ba22f7b31675e61e082a21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+16=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, the sum, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/00695def4b33258214399ac3b4bf68e616d44fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-16\\text{ (A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />.\n~AVM2023\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A\">2005 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/inde